---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout
  title="Stand Out Gang Wars & Base Rooms – Territory & Gang Base Guide | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Complete guide to the Gang System in Roblox STAND OUT. Learn how to create gangs, upgrade base rooms, capture territory, and utilize the 3x Rokakaka greenhouse."
  canonicalPath="gang-wars"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Gang System & Wars' }]}
  schemaType="Article"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 text-xs font-bold mb-3 border border-rose-200">
        <span>Multiplayer Organizations</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Territory &amp; Base Upgrades</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Stand Out Gang Wars &amp; Base Guide
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Gangs in Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong> allow groups of Stand users to band together, claim sovereign base rooms, fight over territory control in town, and unlock powerful shared facilities like the 3x speed Rokakaka greenhouse.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Gang Base Upgrades Grid -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6 mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Gang Base Facilities &amp; Rooms</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-emerald-800 mb-2">1. Rokakaka Growing Room</h3>
          <p>
            The crown jewel of gang upgrades. Grants all members a permanent <strong>3x speed cultivation multiplier</strong> on all planted garden pots, allowing rapid mass farming of Rokakaka mutations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-amber-800 mb-2">2. Armory &amp; Gear Lockers</h3>
          <p>
            Shared gang equipment bank where members can pool spare SWAT vests, D'Arby chips, and steel ingots to assist new recruits leveling their characters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-rose-800 mb-2">3. War Room &amp; Bounty Map</h3>
          <p>
            Displays real-time high-value bounties in your server and monitors rival gang presence across the town plaza and railway station.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Gang Wars Mechanics -->
    <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Gang Wars &amp; Anti-Teaming Rules</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        When fighting rival gangs in the open world, STAND OUT's <strong>Anti-Teaming engine</strong> activates automatically. If two or more enemies strike the same target in rapid succession (within 0.8s), the defending player receives approximately <strong>1 full second of complete invulnerability (i-frames)</strong>. Coordinate your stun timing carefully to avoid granting your opponent free escape frames!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
